<title>FRANCE: Hermes 1997 Q1 sales rise.</title>
<headline>Hermes 1997 Q1 sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter 1997</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					 1,080    vs	944</p>
<p>     - Silks					   297    vs	297</p>
<p>     - Leather					 229    vs	183</p>
<p>     - Ready-to-wear				 183    vs	139</p>
<p>     - Other (incl hats, shoes, stationery)  107    vs	 76</p>
<p>     - Perfume					  56    vs	 64</p>
<p>     - Watches					 104    vs	 96</p>
<p>     - Dining services				40    vs	 41</p>
<p>     - Other					    64    vs	 48</p>
<p>NOTE - Hermes International issued its first-quarter sales in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
